& \Rightarrow \lambda(\lambda+3)-1(\lambda+3)=0, \Rightarrow \lambda=1,-3
\end{aligned}

when $\lambda=1$, then $\vec{b}+\lambda \vec{c}=2 \hat{i}+3 \hat{j}-3 \hat{k}$
